he cancellation), but it changes nothing - the outcome is the same full refund. The traffic-advisory artifact EV-ADVIS-02757-01 is MISSING at weight 0.0, and nothing turns on it: the fee fails without it. The deciding facts are carried by artifacts at weight 1.0 (the chat log, the trip record and the GPS trace), all complete and unimpaired under POL-NS-08, so confidence is not capped below 0.95. The monetary effect, $4.50, is below the POL-GEN-05 execution threshold of $8.00, so the refund executes automatically. No clause produces a referral: there is no arrival marker to record as a false-arrival event under POL-NS-05(ii), the reason code RIDER_CANCELLED was correctly selected, and POL-NS-07 does not engage."
